<title>LATVIA: ROTA FIRST QUARTER LOSS 40,428 LATS.</title>
<headline>ROTA FIRST QUARTER LOSS 40,428 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first quarter loss of Rota Printing House was 40,428 lats on turnover of 60,326 lats, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that the loss came after production expenses of 97,301 lats, which led to a gross loss of 36,975 lats.</p>
<p>The company assets were 737,736 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
